# Plan Ladder Sheet

::summary
The plan ladder sheet (RULED 08-05), opened from the Plan & billing pane's Change plan: tier rows via the PricingTable block with credits/members/features meta; the CURRENT plan is inert and marked with a Current pill; other tiers go to the payment processor checkout (downgrade takes effect at period end). Footer: changes prorate; credits reset on the monthly anniversary; unused top-ups carry over.
::

::modal[name=plan-ladder title="Change plan" width=380 placement=centered dismissible=true]

:::pricing-table[name=plan-ladder-tiers current=ultra action=choosePlan]
Tier | Price
Starter | Free | 200K credits/mo · 1 member
Pro | $19/mo | 5M credits · 3 members · custom domains
Premium | $49/mo | 12M credits · 10 members · heavy-lane routing
**Ultra** | $99/mo | 20M credits · unlimited members · priority lanes — Current
:::

Changes prorate. Credits reset on the monthly anniversary; unused top-ups carry over.

::

Top-right ✕ per dismiss canon. Non-current tier rows route to the payment processor checkout; a downgrade takes effect at period end. Known mockup-internal inconsistency, NOT resolved here: the billing pane's plan card reads "Ultra $200/mo" while this ladder reads "$99/mo" — flagged for a pricing ruling.

At small width (≤ 767px, R-C ruling 08-10) this tall sheet goes edge-to-edge with 10px side insets (auto width), drops to 58px under the top bar, and caps at calc(100vh − 140px) — the body scrolls inside the cap; the wide placement declared on the block is unchanged.
